{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19109","headline":"秘书山崔少监见示坠马长句因而和之 · 刘禹锡","name":"秘书山崔少监见示坠马长句因而和之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"麟台少[监]旧仙郎，洛水桥边坠马伤。\n尘污腰间青襞绶，风飘掌上紫游缰。\n上车着作应来问，折臂三公定送方。\n犹赖德全如醉者，不妨吟咏入篇章。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19109.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19109","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}